tually win over 40 US titles. She lived until her death in Cleveland, Ohio. In December 1980, she was shot to death during a robbery. At her autopsy, it was revealed that she was a gender mosaic, often called a gynandromorph, who had mixed internal genitalia."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "SF"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "368"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/74664"} "Stanisława Walasiewicz"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/POL"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/POL.png"}] "POL"]] [:td {} "11.9 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "11.9 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "11.9 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "89"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/65926"} "Hilda Strike"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CAN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CAN.png"}] "CAN"]] [:td {} "12.3 (3 h1)"] [:td {} "12.4 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "11.9 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "482"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/77997"} "Billie von Bremen"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "12.3 (2 h1)"] [:td {} "12.1 (2 h2)"] [:td {} "12.0 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "182"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/69968"} "Marie Dollinger"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :s